                              "text": "Impact Coordinator João Paulo Veiga, USP (acting)"
                            },
                            {
                              "type": "html",
                              "html": "<p>He holds bachelor's degrees in Business Administration (FGV – SP, 1983) and Social Sciences (USP, 1987), a master's degree in Political Science from USP (1994), and a PhD in Political Science from the University of São Paulo (1999). He is currently an assistant professor at the Faculty of Philosophy, Letters and Human Sciences (FFLCH – USP).</p>"
